message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "nuPG 26: Pulsar Synthesis for SuperCollider"
abstract: >-
  nuPG is a pulsar synthesis program for SuperCollider. It provides multiple
  independent pulsaret trains, a modulation matrix, real-time GUI control, and
  two synthesis engines. The program continues the New Pulsar Generator lineage
  begun in Curtis Roads and Alberto de Campo's original PulsarGenerator (2001).
